  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "I met the man in some dreary, dismal neighborhood.\n\nA man who spewed vulgar curses at all hours and even barged into my home.\nAfter the death of my common-law partner, all that was left for Seon-jae was the child we had together. For that child’s sake, I ended up in an unfamiliar place, but my already shaky life was completely upended when I met this man.\n\n“I wish you’d suck on this for me.”\n\nThe man had no shame, no conscience, not even the barest shred of decency.\nWhat could you do with a man like that?\nThe things you can’t do.\n\nWith this man, there are far too many of those.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/505107932)   \nR15: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/505107935)",
